{"id":"4015966706975570888","query":"concert","source_queries":["concert"],"text":"We made it to the concert late. When it ended at midnight, we had nowhere to go. Every hotel nearby was sold out, so we drove 2.5 hours home in the middle of the night.\n\nI planned this birthday trip carefully, and Orbitz threw it out the window.\n\nOrbitz, a travel company that can’t confirm a reservation exists, has no phone line, and sends customers to oversold hotels has failed at the most basic part of its job. I want a real explanation and a full refund.","username":"unapologetically_jenni","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@unapologetically_jenni/post/De7lHFHEvvI","timestamp":"2026-10-25T20:35:59Z","media_type":"TEXT_POST","is_reply":true,"relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["concert"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr_recent"],"searched_at":"2026-10-25T21:17:09.130736183Z","first_seen_at":"2026-10-25T21:17:15.201821Z","last_seen_at":"2026-10-25T21:17:15.201821Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_e3c29b8d1470dab8","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
